                            "note": "In order to confirm your booking please inform Virgin Atlantic Holidays of the following information at time of booking:  \n\t- First and last name of each guest. This information should match photo-identification.\n\t- Individual body weights. Include unit of weight (pounds, stone, or kilos).\n\t-  Contact mobile number. If international, include country code.\n\nPlease call Maverick on 702-261-0007 to confirm bodyweights and pickup time and location at least 72 hours before scheduled excursion date. If bodyweights are not advised within this time and the helicopter is overweight you will be charged a re-booking fee and no refunds will be given.Valid photo ID will be required on the day of your excursion. The maximum weight limit per person is 300 lbs. and the total passenger weight on the helicopter may not exceed 1,240 lbs. (seven passengers). Guests over the weight limit will be required to purchase 2 seats. \n",
