IS ON REQUEST - NOT CONFIRMED UNTIL REVISED INVOICE SENT\n4 Adults, 0 Children, 0 Infants\nCheck In: Tue 22 Sep 2026 Check Out: Sat 26 Sep 2026\nDuration: 4 Nights\nMeal Plan: Room Only\nRoom Description\nStandard 1 Bed (STD1B) 2 Rooms\n\nHotel: Best Western Plus Sunset Plaza Hotel\nTHIS HOTEL IS ON REQUEST - NOT CONFIRMED UNTIL REVISED INVOICE SENT\n4 Adults, 0 Children, 0 Infants\nCheck In: Sat 26 Sep 2026 Check Out: Wed 30 Sep 2026\nDuration: 4 Nights\nMeal Plan: Room Only\nRoom Description\nKing Room (KIN) 2 Rooms\n\nHotel: Outrigger Waikiki Beach Resort\nTHIS HOTEL IS ON REQUEST - NOT CONFIRMED UNTIL REVISED INVOICE SENT\n4 Adults, 0 Children, 0 Infants\nCheck In: Wed 30 Sep 2026 Check Out: Tue 6 Oct 2026\nDuration: 6 Nights\nMeal Plan: Room Only\nRoom Description\nWaikiki View Room (WAKVR) 2 Rooms\n\nROOM TYPE – *If bed requirements are different to standard please detail what you have done to confirm this and is customer aware? -\n\nBOARD BASIS -\n\nON REQUEST, has the process been advised?\n\nSPECIAL REQUEST, is your request possible in your hotel, i.e. is bedding correct for the room type booked?\n\nHave Resort Fees, Local Fees and Taxes been advised?\n\n*****************************************************\n\n*RESORT TRANSFERS* n\n\nPax weight for helicopter transfer:\n\n*****************************************************\n\n* CAR HIRE *\n\nCar: Chevrolet - Tahoe or similar [1 Car ]\n4 Adults, 0 Children, 0 Infants\nPick up Hertz The Venetian 3355 S Las Vegas Blvd LAS VEGAS NV 89109 Opening times Mon-Fri 07:00-16:00\nSat-Sun 07:00-16:00 Sat 26 Sep 2026\nDrop off Hertz Los Angeles Airport 9000 Airport Blvd LOS ANGELES CA 900450000 Opening times 24/7 Wed 30\nSep 2026\nInsurance Hertz Go\nNotes\nIMPORTANT INFORMATION\n\nBooked for full duration?\nIf not what are other arrangements?\n\nIs pick up time 2 after landing and drop off 3 hours before departure?\n\nDoes the car pick up and drop off at the correct locations?\n\nIs car size adequate for party?\n\nCar