                {
                    "no": 7,
                    "type": "RESERVATION",
                    "note": "Karen Sullivan\n​TESTFIRSTNAME TESTLASTNAME <lisafarmer_2@hotmail.co.uk>​\n​stephen.farmer3@icloud.com​\nHI TESTFIRSTNAME & Stephen,\n\nI hope you are doing well, I just tried to give you a call and I've left you a voicemail.\n\nI'm emailing to let you know that your holiday is now in date range and I can confirm the hotels and flights on your advance registration booking.\n\nI've confirmed all your hotels but the Bellagio is more than double the price of what the provisional price was that we based the quote on. This must be due to the rooms now all being newly renovated. I've managed to get some of the other hotel a little cheaper so the jump isn't so much but it's still more than we expected. We could look at alternatives.\n\nI've managed to have the flight from Honolulu added to your current Virgin Atlantic flight booking in comfort plus for less than expected but the flight from LAX to HNL is expensive if I add it into the fare, it will be cheaper if we add it separately as a published fare. Adding as a published fare makes the flight non changeable or refundable and your checked baggage there is a charge of around $35 but it will still works out around £700  cheaper than adding it into the fare.\n\nIf you would like to stick with the Bellagio and add the flight from LAX to HNL as a published fare there are few different departure times but the lowest price is the flight below:\n\n\n13:10  - 16:05\n\n\nThe current package price with all the hotels and flights confirmed apart from the LAX-HNL flight included is £12121.58. \nif we add the flight in it will bring the total to £13454.04. I will be able to change the car hire times once the flight is booked, this will reduce the cost by £202. Bringing the total to £13251.07.\n\nPlease let me know what you'd like to do, we do work on a live booking system so prices can change.\n\nWould you like to look at alternative lower priced hotels in Las Vegas?\nAre you happy for me to confirm the published fare flight in comfort plus from LAX-HNL?\n\nI look forward to hearing from you, I'm in store this evening and then I'm back in on Tuesday but I'll be checking my emails over the weekend and will be able to get back to you.\n\nKind regards,",
                    "displayName": "Karen Sullivan",
                    "dateModified": "2025-11-14T18:00:21",
                    "systemGenerated": false,
                    "key": "RS~7",
                    "noteId": 0
                }
            ],
