                {
                    "no": 16,
                    "code": "Bellagio - Resort Fee/Parking 2024 and onwards",
                    "description": "Bellagio - Resort Fee/Parking 2024 and onwards",
                    "note": "Please be advised Bellagio has a mandatory resort fee of $55 per room per \nnight, plus tax which is payable locally. In order to settle this cost, you will need \nto pay at the hotel when you check in.\n\nSelf-parking $20 and valet parking $40 per night which is payable locally, subject \nto change.\n\nThe resort fee is set by the accommodation provider, not the tour operator, so \nVirgin Atlantic Holidays cannot control the level of the fee, and it can change at \nany time.",
                    "dateModified": "2025-01-24T11:03:54",
                    "external": true,
                    "internal": true,
